      "content": "I hear the deep pain in the feeling that you are \"fundamentally broken,\" and please know that a few self-critical thoughts do not reflect your entire self or your essential nature. This exhausting cycle of trying to \"fix\" things often happens because we try to do both the fix and the self-judgment at the same time, which makes everything worse. You do not have to be \"okay\" to deserve help or to exist as a bleeding heart.",
